{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15483","headline":"哭张南史因寄南史侄叔宗 · 李端","name":"哭张南史因寄南史侄叔宗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"争路忽摧车，沈钩未得鱼。\n结交唯我少，丧旧自君初。\n谏草文难似，围棊智不如。\n仲宣新有赋，叔夜近无书。\n地闭滕公宅，山荒谢客庐。\n歼良从此恨，福善竟成虚。\n酿酒多同醉，烹鸡或取余。\n阮咸虽永别，岂共仲容疎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15483.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15483","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}